nce/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/54f588e00853e81c9aececc72d9474b6816aaec1c979ca3d940c0030c2e401ab.svg)\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/eb5e875b9bf93096c7a1745a02fae75a8be75ab827b1f624fab5e2804cdedb73.svg)\n\nTaking the cube root of each part of the inequality gives\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/9d2b62267e10537690522252c069b2a24b1e95b92321ddad314ada26aa0114b6.svg)\n\nTherefore, ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/a8298b42ebec3ef477881da10ec20db7e50de91740a8a950f104e6be8603bb82.svg) lies between ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/402ff5d0c0c3aaa47f18c89f6d96c95d47840eac13822d596a51bdb0c5f9a4ab.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/85ab4d14e4ae710116ac84de4b03b3cf35723ab969b7abfba97889c497974147.svg)",
